          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Ruined Flying Machine reclaimed",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "在毁坏的弩车、毁坏的投石车和毁坏的飞行器附近种下附魔种子。",
      "title": "化兵为绿",
